{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14499","headline":"暮春沐发晦日书怀寄韦功曹渢李录事从训王少府纯 · 戴叔伦","name":"暮春沐发晦日书怀寄韦功曹渢李录事从训王少府纯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝沐敞南闱，盘跚待日曦。\n持梳发更落，览镜意多违。\n吾友见尝少，春风去不归。\n登高取一醉，犹可及芳菲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14499.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14499","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}